\[
\boxed{
\operatorname{Compat}_{\operatorname{Adm}}(C,D)
=
\left\{
(c,d)\mid
\exists x,
\operatorname{Adm}(x)
\land q_Cx=c
\land q_Dx=d
\right\}.
}
\]

一般只有：

\[
\operatorname{Compat}_{\operatorname{Adm}}(C,D)
\subseteq
\operatorname{Im}_{\operatorname{Adm}}(C)
\times
\operatorname{Im}_{\operatorname{Adm}}(D).
\]

